$ eden-god where rest
  (14.8, 25.33): ground y 0, slope 0°, walk
    within: meadow [decor], trail [surface], rest [solid]
    nearest: meadow 0 m ne, trail 0 m nw, rest 0 m sw, tree 3.25 m ne, tree-2 3.82 m w, tree-3 3.82 m se, rock 6.75 m n, rock-2 16.53 m nw
